'' Constant folding has to be EXACT -- close is simply wrong, and every way to be
'' wrong here is quiet. The values came out of fbc one bit at a time through
'' '#assert', because '#print' does not fold: it echoes its tokens.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --check tests/types/src/constfold.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: const 2 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: const 3 -3
'' EXPECT-OUT: const 4 -1
'' EXPECT-OUT: const 5 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: const 6 -1
'' EXPECT-OUT: const 7 4294967296
'' EXPECT-OUT: const 8 -1
'' EXPECT-OUT: const 9 -1
'' EXPECT-OUT: const 10 -4
'' EXPECT-OUT: const 11 2
'' EXPECT-OUT: const 12 4
'' EXPECT-OUT: const 13 -3
'' EXPECT-OUT: const 14 -2
'' EXPECT-OUT: const 15 -2147483648
'' EXPECT-OUT: const 16 5
'' EXPECT-OUT: const 17 65
'' EXPECT-OUT: const 18 20
